  mailType: 1
  title: "OFFICIAL MINER STATUS CONFIRMATION"
  message: "Congratulations!\n\nThe system has successfully registered your Labor License upgrade. From this moment forward, you are officially recognized as a Staff Miner within the Corporation's roster.\n\nAlong with your new title, your daily KPI requirements have been updated. We expect a high level of professionalism and efficiency to ensure the resource supply chain remains uninterrupted.\n\nExceptional performance exceeding the target will be recognized and rewarded accordingly.\n\nSincerely,\nHuman Resources Executive Board."
